# Enforce LF in the repository regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true silently convert every text file to CRLF on disk while
# git stores (and Linux CI checks out) LF — invisible for most tooling, but
# a real bug for anything that hashes or extracts multi-line string content
# byte-for-byte, like scripts/i18n/extract-literals.mjs and copy-lock.json.
# Found 2026-08-04 when a local check:all pass didn't reproduce on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
